  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institutional Capacity Building for the Transport Sector in Uganda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The action aims to improve the transport sector in terms of sector governance, planning, implementation and sustainability of infrastructure. Support will be given to government institutions in the transport sector in the delivery of their respective mandates. In addition, it will support the local construction industry through the Uganda Institution of Professional Engineers to increase local participation in infrastructure projects.</narrative>
  </description>
